  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-plays-in-the-sand-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "e264e321569435692daff293667cfd62abda82922a9298df046c35c4830da49f",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "378ed7bdca433318d24ce12e219be4741719e44755a41bc8b2f864b1f8bf8b47",
      "text": "悟空去海边\n玩沙",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4fe6fb1ad5679dd494b86134166865a8e69e81252125ae9b5eac6c89ddafe681",
      "text": "悟空刚到海边，\n就蹲下来堆沙子。\n“我要堆一座大沙山！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7d6fe5e8adb4f06a3f0fa61aeffe43ce8e61565f469ea22638c71543990853af",
      "text": "他装了满满一桶干沙。\n把桶一倒——\n哗啦，全散了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a0041a893ed401f6b4b539d9a7bb5be5e24e9bda1696990c7f61555218d5c89a",
      "text": "八戒把桶往头上一扣。\n“嘿，新帽子！\n悟空，你也试试？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8f4d247bf9ec92dbd740b1bdaf212d5f8329da6b1679c216380ffd7da5f7a684",
      "text": "敖丙提来一小桶水。\n“沙子太干啦，\n加点水试试！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "86397a3821b7b73bd3420d883b34d71c34070e5b413da3f182a3546418f3361c",
      "text": "咕嘟咕嘟，水倒多了。\n“哎呀，变成沙子汤啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "83a7ad4ef1e93749ebd999228a1c03abc647998998541fba1be001c03ae75845",
      "text": "悟空把桶一放。\n“怎么堆个沙山这么难呀！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ece2e1eb597e30f4cd886f7670d56be240efe9df3b320ef8f03001ef4e21a90e",
      "text": "沙僧说：“再来一次吧。”\n“先放干沙，再加一点水。”\n悟空点点头。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a124708f15a0756f1de2861cbaf6a6b71ab68145bcc8bac4c16b18ed579fdb74",
      "text": "他们拌拌沙子，再捏一捏。\n嘿，湿沙捏成团了！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b735ef403047d8b729baa308d42b9446bc5b6b7333f6ab6b2ea4b16a8d5ed865",
      "text": "往桶里装，装满啦！\n再拍一拍，拍结实。\n“好了吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6bc3a5c6efc495b90240aea41beef14003a319ebeb0a44e8414c6addb188cf3b",
      "text": "小桶倒扣在沙地上。\n轻轻一提——\n“这回没塌！一座小沙塔！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9d89cd7da0b20a155e0f0e2f0570c6b2253e1d13c6eca227321e52520dfadd7f",
      "text": "悟空在旁边堆座小山。\n八戒把桶倒扣过来，\n做了个圆圆的“沙蛋糕”。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a489c90989751ae3d4bf711917e2aacd1eb3a093b6b73a3a6237b03e08b59b9",
      "text": "敖丙绕着沙塔挖一圈，\n再倒上水。\n小水池也有啦！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2abd1306adf1d0ddd7f275e6962619e11b0dc424086e915bf79b99f34561f41a",
      "text": "八戒问：“里面住着谁？”\n“一个小国王呀！”\n悟空笑嘻嘻地说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "36ae2f147ca18b6a656cd68ff132616297d5a0f5b02094d0c20badcaa34a3481",
      "text": "大家收好桶和小铲子。\n沙僧拿来小刷子，\n帮悟空刷掉身上的沙。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5c7ab58d22550b3603d71fac2e9cb8efff202b9aaf5894b252591ea61f4abac4",
      "text": "悟空脱下鞋，倒了倒。\n哗啦！\n“鞋里还藏着一座小沙山！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
